      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHITE HOT DREAMS (5) jumped favourite and was too quick with an all-the-way win last start (19.64) at this track in a TG1-4W over 342m. Solid beginner who can clear the tricky draw. Expected to go well again. CATCH MY DESIGN (2) broke from the inside draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only 1.3 lengths (19.64) behind Toora Terry at this track. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Expected to feature again. BINNAWAY WIZARD (7) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing sixth (23.14) in a Grade 5 at Gawler. Form here at the trip sound including five wins. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from five starts. Has ability and can measure up. AILEEN'S SHINE (8) is a last start winner who rates one of the chances again.",
